{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Graines de Coron","6 femmes, 6 hommes se racontent. Ce film retrace la vie d'enfants nés après-guerre et tente de mesurer l'empreinte qu'ont laissés ces trois siècles d'exploitation du charbon. En suivant le parcours de chacun d'entre eux, il pointe le poids de la culture ouvrière sur la capacité à se projeter un avenir. Il aborde la question de l'immigration des années 20 à 60 et souligne la difficulté pour les femmes de sortir du schéma traditionnel et leur plus difficile accès à une formation qualifiante. Plus globalement, il met en évidence le peu d'accompagnement qui fut proposé à cette génération et le poids du déterminisme social.",[4,5],"cultural memory","personal memory",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":33,"media":35,"synopsis":38,"production":39,"characters":42,"roles":43,"awards":54,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_244","fr2023-244-graines-de-coron",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2023-01-01",2023,"Documentary",[18,25,29],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":24},"André Grégorcic","andre-gregorcic",0,"Male identifying","France",[],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":28},"Christian Grégorcic","christian-gregorcic",[],{"id":30,"slug":31,"name":30,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":32},"Bernard Grégorcic","bernard-gregorcic",[],[34],"Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":36,"trailerUrl":37},"https://www.cinema-les-etoiles.fr/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Site-Affiche_Graines-de-Coron.png","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rsjkxYKy7uw",{"native":2,"english":11},[40],{"country":23,"share":41},"Majority coproducer",[],[44,48,51],{"person":45,"role":47},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":21,"gender